Project overview
This is a grade management system which allows users to enter student records, validate grades, calculate averages, display reports, and manage student data using lists, tuples, and dictionaries.

Section A

Section A practices the use of scalar varuiables, uer input, loops, conditional statements, input validation and basic math calculations.

Features:

Grade validation
Student data entry
Grade calculations

